<!--
  Audio: a row of bars, stroked.

  Outline, not filled. The filled Material glyphs this replaced read as a solid
  blob once they were tinted dark on the white focus disc, and a blob is not an
  icon. Everything here is a stroke on a 24 unit grid at width 2, which is the
  weight the Amazon player draws, so the row reads as one set.
-->
